~ start
if not QuestManager.is_quest_active(QuestIds.LOSTFLUTE) and not QuestManager.is_quest_completed(QuestIds.LOSTFLUTE)
	=> accept_quest
elif QuestManager.is_quest_active(QuestIds.LOSTFLUTE)
	=> submit_quest
else
	Nero: Thank you retrieve my flute!
=> END

~ accept_quest
Nero: Hey Hero, I lost my magical flute, would you kindly retrieve it for me?
Nero: I guess it's in the [b]Dark Dungeon[/b]!
- Ok (Accept quest)
	$> QuestManager.start_quest(QuestIds.LOSTFLUTE)
	Nero: That's really kind of you!
- Not now, sorry
	Nero: Ok, I'll try my luck other ways.
=> END

~ submit_quest
$> locals.quest = QuestManager.get_quest_by_entity_id(QuestIds.LOSTFLUTE)
$> locals.step = locals.quest.steps[1]
$> locals.flute = inventory.get_slot(locals.step.item)
#$> debug(locals.flute)
Nero: Have you found my flute?
- Yes, take this (hand over flute) [if locals.flute /]
	$> locals.quest.steps[0].set_locked(true)
	$> PlayerManager.deliver_item(locals.step.item, locals.step.quantity, locals.step.to)
	$> QuestManager.complete_quest(QuestIds.LOSTFLUTE)
	Nero: Oh, you're the savior, thanks!
- Not yet
	Nero: Nevermind, keep it up!
=> END